    Player: '63 (Sixty-Three): four players in two partnerships. 9 cards each then bid (40-63); 4 more cards then discard to 6. Only trump cards score (A=1, K=25, 9=9, 5=5, 3=15, etc; total 63). Make bid to score; first to 152 or 250 wins.',
